              "value": "KNOWLEDGE BASE\nKB-01 | Plans: Basic 39 EUR/month, Plus 59 EUR/month, Elite 89 EUR/month, billed monthly in advance.\nKB-02 | Freeze: Plus and Elite can freeze up to 60 days per calendar year, minimum 7 days per freeze, requested in writing. Basic memberships cannot be frozen.\nKB-03 | Cancellation: 30 days written notice. The minimum contract term is 6 months.\nKB-04 | Guest passes: Basic none, Plus 2 per month, Elite 5 per month. Guests must be 16 or older.\nKB-05 | Opening hours: Mon-Fri 06:00-23:00, Sat-Sun 08:00-21:00. Elite members have 24/7 badge access.\nKB-06 | Personal training: 45 EUR per session. A package of 10 sessions costs 400 EUR and is valid for 6 months.\nKB-07 | Refunds: prepaid unused periods are refunded pro rata minus a 15 EUR administration fee. Requests are processed within 14 days.\nKB-08 | Group classes: booking opens 7 days in advance. After 2 no-shows in a calendar month a 5 EUR no-show fee applies.\nKB-09 | Lockers: day lockers are free. An annual rented locker costs 60 EUR.\nKB-10 | Corporate: companies with 10 or more employees get 20% off the monthly fee. Contracts are prepared by the sales team.",
